# Stalls' builds when owners crowd one plot (D388): three owners, there from
# the start, point at the same plot and build in the same tick, before any
# step has seen a stall there. One stall stands, never three; and an owner
# short of the cost builds nothing (the fourth starts with no coins).
program tycoon.kest
physics3d gravity 0 -10 0
navigation radius 0.35 height 1.8 step 0.3 slope 30 cell 0.2
collision class stall b0eb8fc52cd9d4ac
collision class customer 1a6375d11861b18d
component 0097c04f-e081-44c5-b93d-ba7a6836d3e8 tycoon.hand Hand
component 4143f760-31c1-469d-bda7-7946878bcaba tycoon.owner Owner
component 20f1dacf-e8f6-4c1f-be56-5fc36f9ade8e tycoon.stall Stall
component bd13f2d3-dc87-46f2-b480-ff2eaf5fcdf1 tycoon.customer Customer
component d00b9d85-270c-4c13-a1ee-f423ffa148c8 tycoon.amble Amble
animator 4d2c8e71a9f03b56 amble.rfanim parameters tycoon.amble
component 160c062b-09b3-46a0-8435-9575f99339c1 tycoon.till Till
component 11a256e6-f691-4f0f-8feb-aef4694891f0 tycoon.gate Gate
component 7c496087-7144-4230-85e9-fd119433276c tycoon.round Round
component c6cf12bf-81c1-4db9-a042-e3883a084d52 tycoon.named rawframe.ui.Typed
entity tycoon.stall owner
system tycoon.join simulation join write tycoon.owner
system tycoon.tend simulation tend read tycoon.hand write tycoon.owner write rawframe.physics3d.pose entities lookup tycoon.stall after tycoon.join after rawframe.physics3d.step
system tycoon.earn simulation earn write tycoon.owner entities lookup tycoon.stall lookup tycoon.till after tycoon.tend
message won Won
# The program reads its players' collect command (D425).
command collect controls.Collect
command sign controls.Sign
spawn 1 rawframe.physics3d.body motion=0 shape=1 width=24 height=0.5 depth=24 rawframe.physics3d.pose y=-0.5 rawframe.physics3d.velocity
spawn 3 tycoon.hand pointed=1 pointX=1 pointZ=1 build=1 tycoon.owner rawframe.physics3d.pose
spawn 1 tycoon.hand pointed=1 pointX=9 pointZ=9 build=1 tycoon.owner joined=1 rawframe.physics3d.pose
